{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/6a656c92f9c7ed8a23149808119489f1.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/6a656c92f9c7ed8a23149808119489f1.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bobo Bay</strong> is a pet simulation game where you collect, mash(breed), accessorize, and train little creatures to compete in races and other competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/ac2c948006498c14d9a8dd7d282600b5.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of combinations. Body color, eye color, body part shapes, patterns, sheens, stats, personality traits, etc will all change with each Bobo you find or mash!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Distinct Bobo traits and moods will completely change how you interact and care for your Bobos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bobos start their life as <strong>Saplings and\u00a0</strong>grow into a <strong>Seedling,</strong>\u00a0developing based on their stats, before finally growing to a full grown\u00a0<strong>Bud</strong>. When the time is right, they will then\u00a0<strong>Sprout</strong>, giving you the chance to let it evolve! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss the chance to take down the legendary <strong>Bobo Stars</strong>. If your Bobo beats one of these blockheads then you'll be rewarded with a brand new sapling that is the same species as the Bobo Star. Watch out for those Phantoms...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/792182021bfee46feb889003d6d535d7.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/ee68803fd0f7e22608a78a0f1e2dda13.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/ee68803fd0f7e22608a78a0f1e2dda13.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials:</strong> Scheduled competitions every day that any Bobo can enter. Train up for relay races as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sagas:</strong> The main progression of Bobo Bay, where you complete all contests, in order, with the same Bobo. Completing Sagas will bring the biggest rewards, including new maps, new species of Bobos, and special town unlocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/8cdcfc85a400809cb93be4e9018a0a24.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Bobo can come with different colors, patterns, and animal parts, which you can discover by finding them out in the wild, or by mashing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/e5b5e93ee27e593639f432d24db7c25d.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/e5b5e93ee27e593639f432d24db7c25d.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't forget to dress them up in a fancy little top hat as well, or make some wacky outfits!  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/a71a2b9a86f6297c6fc14e155ddf3dea.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through a cute little town to buy accessories for your Bobos to wear, register a new Bobo, visit the doctor, drop them off at camp, purchase snacks for your Bobo to eat, or even adopt a Bobo from the shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/52de0b247c0cfdba5453ad2e523b535e.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/52de0b247c0cfdba5453ad2e523b535e.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Watch out for the alley at night...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/0397a5feb611bdc42e0bc77b5f93e069.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All competitions have scheduled dates they will be held. Check the competition calendar on the Competition Center\u00a0<strong>Jumbotron</strong> to sign up for any competitions that seem tempting! Some competitions will take place every day and night, while others might only happen once a week. Plan ahead and make sure your Bobos are ready to eradicate the competition when the time comes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will always be worth checking out each area every day and night. You wouldn't want to miss how rowdy the town gets when celebrating World Day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/b48aeaae3877af92dd9c11ffbc19430d.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/b48aeaae3877af92dd9c11ffbc19430d.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1889810?t=1763402891","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1889810?t=1763402891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/8dedec85c8ce2ccbf6d33d928e585067db42fc37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763402891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/8dedec85c8ce2ccbf6d33d928e585067db42fc37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763402891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description