ing you the chance to let it evolve! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss the chance to take down the legendary <strong>Bobo Stars</strong>. If your Bobo beats one of these blockheads then you'll be rewarded with a brand new sapling that is the same species as the Bobo Star. Watch out for those Phantoms...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/792182021bfee46feb889003d6d535d7.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/ee68803fd0f7e22608a78a0f1e2dda13.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/ee68803fd0f7e22608a78a0f1e2dda13.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials:</strong> Scheduled competitions every day that any Bobo can enter. Train up for relay races as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sagas:</strong> The main progression of Bobo Bay, where you complete all contests, in order, with the same Bobo. Completing Sagas will bring the biggest rewards, including new maps, new species of Bobos, and special town unlocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/8cdcfc85a400809cb93be4e9018a0a24.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Bobo can come with different colors, patterns, and animal parts, which you can discover by finding them out in the wild, or by mashing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/e5b5e93ee27e593639f432d24db7c25d.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/e5b5e93ee27e593639f432d24db7c25d.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don't forget to dress them up in a fancy little top hat as well, or make some wacky outfits!  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/a71a2b9a86f6297c6fc14e155ddf3dea.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through a cute little town to buy accessories for your Bobos to wear, register a new Bobo, visit the doctor, drop them off at camp, purchase snacks for your Bobo to eat, or even adopt a Bobo from the shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/52de0b247c0cfdba5453ad2e523b535e.poster.avif?t=1763402891\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/52de0b247c0cfdba5453ad2e523b535e.webm?t=1763402891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"